      "title": "Guide — Direct3D-V3 High-Detail Mesh Refinement & 6-View Multiview Suite (8GB+ VRAM INT8 / FP16)",
      "properties": {
        "Node name for S&R": "Note"
      },
      "widgets_values": [
        "WORKFLOW 19 : ZIGGART DIRECT3D-V3 HIGH-DETAIL MESH REFINEMENT & MULTIVIEW\n0. MODEL DOWNLOADER (Ziggart3DModelDownloader) : Pre-downloads MostAadTech/Direct3D-V3-int8 (1024_only ~1.3 GB) plus optional 512/1536 INT8 or DreamTechAI FP16 stages and DINOv3 ViT-H+ weights.\n1. PATH A (Organic / Character Refinement) : LoadImage -> ZiggartHunyuan3DImageToMesh (coarse mesh) -> ZiggartDirect3DV3Refine (resolution=1024, sharp_edges=false, guidance_method=cfg, color_transfer=transfer_from_coarse) -> Ziggart3DTurntableRenderer -> Ziggart3DTurntableGifSaver + PreviewImage.\n2. PATH B (Hard-Surface / Sharp Edges) : LoadImage -> ZiggartSPAR3DImageToMesh (coarse textured mesh) -> ZiggartDirect3DV3Refine (resolution=1536, sharp_edges=true, guidance_method=fdg, speed_mode=fast) -> PreviewImage.\n3. PATH C (6-View Multiview Refinement) : Front LoadImage + optional back/left/right LoadImage nodes + coarse ZIGGART_MESH (or set mesh_path) -> ZiggartDirect3DV3RefineMultiview (multiview_speed=fast, guidance_method=apg) -> PreviewImage."
      ],
